          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What Are Freeze Dried Beef Dog Treats?</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h6>Freeze drying is an excellent option for preserving the nutrients, flavor, and aroma of food. Freeze dried beef dog treats are made from wild-caught beef, preserving its high-quality protein, omega-3 fatty acids, and essential vitamins. Unlike many other treats, they are free from preservatives, fillers, and artificial additives, making them an ideal choice for dogs with food sensitivities or allergies.</h6><h6>Freeze beef is packed with omega-3 fatty acids, which support a healthy coat, joint mobility, and heart health. By adding freeze dried beef dog treats to your dog’s diet, you’re providing them with a treat that’s both delicious and full of health benefits.</h6>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
