          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Health Benefits of Snarky Pets' Dog Meatball Treats</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>High-Quality Protein for Muscle Development</strong><br/>Protein is essential for muscle repair and growth, and these meatball treats are a fantastic source of it. Whether you have an active dog or one that’s recovering from an injury, the protein in these treats supports your dog’s muscle health and helps them stay strong and energized.<br/><br/><strong>No Additives or Preservatives</strong><br/>Unlike many commercial dog treats that are loaded with preservatives and fillers, Snarky Pets' Dog Meatball Treats are made with only natural ingredients. This means your dog is getting a clean, healthy snack that you can feel good about giving them.<br/><br/><strong>Supports Joint Health</strong><br/>These treats help support your dog’s joint health, thanks to the high-quality protein and the natural fats they contain. For older dogs or those with joint issues, this can be particularly beneficial, as it can reduce inflammation and improve mobility.<br/><br/><strong>Suitable for Dogs of All Ages</strong><br/>Whether you have a puppy, an adult dog, or a senior dog, these meatballs are suitable for all stages of life. The treats are gentle on their stomachs and provide essential nutrients that are perfect for growing puppies or senior dogs.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
